```mermaid
graph TD
    subgraph Organization Management Account
        Billing[Consolidated Billing]
        CUR[Cost & Usage Report]
        Budgets[AWS Budgets]
    end
    
    subgraph Member Accounts
        Acc1[Prod Account - EC2/RDS]
        Acc2[Dev Account - EKS/Lambda]
    end
    
    Acc1 -->|Usage Data| Billing
    Acc2 -->|Usage Data| Billing
    
    Billing -->|Generates Parquet| S3Bucket[(Central S3 Bucket)]
    S3Bucket -->|Analyzed By| Athena[Amazon Athena]
    Athena -->|Visualized By| QuickSight[Amazon QuickSight Dashboards]
    
    Budgets -->|Exceeds Threshold| SNS[SNS Alert]
    SNS --> Slack[FinOps Slack Channel]
```
